r White","Lou Beatty Jr.","Brian Howe","E.J. Callahan","Elizabeth Greer","Jerome Ro Brooks","Monyque Thompson Scott","John O'Leary","Patti Yasutake","Brian Cousins","Lanei Chapman","Ron Dean","Tony Pasqualini","Myra Turley","Aaron Hill","Dion Anderson","Allen Cutler","Franc Ross","Lorenzo James Henrie","Jack Donner","Ben Pluimer","Steph DuVall","Davenia McFadden","Channing Chase","Scott Michael Campbell","Susan Beaubian","Eve Brenner","Ryun Yu","Jessika Van","Shane Johnson","John Griffin","Brian Silverman","Abigail Mavity","Lynn Hamilton","Marla Gibbs","Madison Mason","James Ingersoll","Ray Stoney","Doug Kruse","John Benjamin Martin","Carolyn McCormick","Nick Price","Euriamis Losada","Kandis Fay","James Martin Kelly","Eric Fischer","Matt O'Toole","Ramon Fernandez","Dylan Kussman","James Moses Black","Marcus DeAnda","Billy Jayne","Brandon Scott","Elizabeth De Razzo","Lisa Waltz","Patrick St. Esprit","Earl Billings","Andrew James Allen","Todd Waring","Robert Romanus","Karen Landry","Akiko Morison","T.E. Russell","Michael Bryan French","Lester Speight","Dex Elliott Sanders","Michael Wiseman","Tamara Braun","Lillian Lehman","Jackie Swanson","Paul Jenkins","Trevor Jackson","Stacy Hall","Craig muMs Grant","Louis Giambalvo","John Callahan","Lauren Cohan","Sam Scarber","Ajay Mehta","James Jordan","Todd Grinnell","Joel McKinnon Miller","Gonzalo Menendez","Jeremy Shada","Julianna McCarthy","Vernee Watson","Rafael Francisco","Karl Makinen","Lois Hall","Henry G. Sanders","Leslie Silva","Manny Perez","Matthew Glave","Richard Roat","James Shanklin","Adam LaVorgna","Anne Gee Byrd","Matt Bushell","Charles Hoyes","Al Pugliese","Mark Beltzman","Dan Desmond","Wolf Muser","John Lawlor","Kat Sawyer","Alice Hirson","Norma Maldonado","Joshua Harto","Anthony Molinari","Jeremy Roberts","Hildy Brooks","Kelly Mantle","James Sutorius","Linda Gehringer","Peter Haskell","Julie Ariola","Steve Stapenhorst","John Sloman","Robin Pearson Rose","Patricia Bethune","Deborah Geffner","Johnathan Tchaikovsky","H. Richard Greene","Sherman Howard","Mo McRae","Douglas Smith","Rif Hutton","Tom Hallick","Kathleen Lloyd","Lisa Long","Brandon Routh","Melissa Yvonne Lewis","Beata Poźniak Daniels","Brent Huff","Jeffrey Nordling","Alan Pietruszewski","Geoffrey Lewis","Ryan Alosio","Samantha Eggar","Molly Cheek","Bruce Gray","Johanna Watts","Chris Sarandon","Tommy Hinkley","David Andriole","Noelle Evans","James Mathers","Jim Meskimen","Blake Robbins","John Kassir","Patty McCormack","W. Earl Brown","Robert Rusler","Alec Medlock","Mae Whitman","Vicellous Reon Shannon","Tangi Miller","Brian Guest","Shirley Knight","Jenna Fischer","Curt Lowens","Robert Catrini","Cody McMains","Roxanne Hart","Matt DeCaro","Michelle Krusiec","Lesley Fera"],"screenwriters":["Liz W. Garcia","Veena Sud","Tyler Bensinger","Meredith Stiehm","Greg Plageman","Sean Whitesell","Christopher Silber","Andrea Newman","John Brian King","Jerome Schwartz","Jay Beattie","Elwood Reid","Gavin Harris","Dan Dworkin","Kim Newton","Gina Gionfriddo","Samantha Corbin-Miller","Chris Mundy","Craig Turk","Erica L. Anderson","Denise Thé","Laurie Arent","Jennifer Johnson","Erica Shelton","Henry Robles","Jason Tracey","Craig S. O'Neill","Adam Glass","Elle Triedman","Kate Purdy","Jan Oxenberg","Taylor Elmore","Danny Pino","Ryan Farley","Stacy Kravetz"],"cinematographers":["Donald E. Thorin Jr.","Paul M. Sommers","Cort Fey","Patrick Cady","Eric Schmidt","John Smith","Robert LaBonge","Tom Richmond"],"composers":["Michael A. Levine"],"reviews":[{"author":"Gemini","text":"Jerry Bruckheimer neodolal a přispěl svojí troškou nikoli do mlýna a už vůbec ne mlýna s princeznou, ale do rodinky krimiseriálů řešících někdy i desítky let ladem ležící nedořešené případy či revidující případy už uzavřené. A činí tak přesně podle svého stylu, s pohlednou grafickou stránkou, sympatickou hlavní postavou a zde navíc i s výborně vybíranou doprovodnou hudbou. Ano, jsou scénky, ve kterých máte pocit, že skutečně jde o něco víc než jen \"další detektivku\", ale těch je opravdu poskrovnu. I tak je to ovšem daleko lepší než nějaký nablblý Derrick a jeho Roman Tyčka. 60% a vzkaz tvůrcům: učte se od mistrů jako je Dick Wolf.(05.03.2007)","stars":3},{"author":"kingik","text":"Tenhle seriál má jednu výraznou slabinu a tou je jeho stále dokola se opakující scénář. Zvláštní, že řada zapeklitých, x let starých případů, není vyřešena, ale sotva se toho chopí jednotka specializující se na odložené případy, je vše zdárně vyřešeno. Pokud někomu tento nesmysl nevadí, tak prosím. 60%(28.02.2009)","stars":3},{"author":"rawen","text":"Nedá mi abych nehodnotil - celý seriál si může být jakkoliv zajímavý (jako by to dnes ještě někdo v té přehršli detektivních seriálů poznal a rozlišil) - vše ale zaručeně zadupe do země závěr každé epizody, kde ve zpomalených záběrech defilují před objektivem zamyšlené tváře jednotlivých aktérů daného dílu, to vše podmalováné rádoby dojemnou skladbou (výběr je různý) - - - tato \"featura\" má zřejmě celý díl zhodnotit, zakončit a z diváka vymáčknout nějaký ten pocit - - - v celkovém dopadu je to ale něco tak PŘÍŠERNĚ TRAPNÉHO, DEMENTNÍHO, KULERVOUCÍHO, NEUVĚŘITELNÉHO, že ani slova nestačí. Je to běs! Je to běs!!! ....doporučuji nekoukat až do konce(26.05.2008)","stars":1}],"vods":[{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.5875f21b-3ab2-4016-9c67-f1ea1ec87ffe"},{"platform":"Oneplay","url":"https://www.oneplay.cz/porad/345562-odlozene-pripady"},{"platform":"Telly","url":"https://telly.cz/program/odlozene-pripady/"},{"platform":"SledovaniTV","url":"https://sledovanitv.cz/epg/event/telka:20260716ac04354abf5f46754dfc63a17788a6bd"},{"platform":"Lepší.TV","url":"https://www.lepsi.tv/top_tv/serial/odlozene-pripady-online?utm_source=csfd&utm_content=csfd"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/136239-odlozene-pripady/prehled/","root_id":136239,"root_title_id":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":7,"episode_count":156,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}